# Where the Contact form + Chatbot enquiries are sent (POST, multipart/form-data).
# Works with Formspree, Getform, Basin, Web3Forms or your own API endpoint.
# Example: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
# If left empty, the site falls back to opening the visitor's email app (mailto).
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
